    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>You curl a finger. A thin spiral of wind catches the object and lays it on the path toward your hand.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Maneuver</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>None (no roll)</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>One visible unattended object of Bulk 1 orless within 5 squares.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Magic / Utility</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>Move the object up to 5 squares toward you along an open path. Catch it if it reaches your free hand, or leave it in the last square reached.</p></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/c5c84c0da3a5bd54b2553426408d1ea581fe22b9/design/cards/storm-on-a-string.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/storm-on-a-string.md</a> at <code>c5c84c0da3a5bd54b2553426408d1ea581fe22b9</code>.</p></section>",
